{title: When the Saints Go Marching In}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{key: G}
{tempo: 110}
{difficulty: beginner}
{tags: spiritual, jazz, folk}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Oh when the [G]saints go marching in
Oh when the saints go marching [D]in
Oh [G]Lord, I [G7]want to [C]be in that number
When the [G]saints go [D]marching [G]in

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Oh when the [G]sun refuse to shine
Oh when the sun refuse to [D]shine
Oh [G]Lord, I [G7]want to [C]be in that number
When the [G]sun re[D]fuse to [G]shine

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Oh when the [G]trumpet sounds its call
Oh when the trumpet sounds its [D]call
Oh [G]Lord, I [G7]want to [C]be in that number
When the [G]trumpet [D]sounds its [G]call

